  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Given ray AB and line m through M: the bold m1 is co-directed with AB, the thin m2 oppositely directed. Central symmetry at M checks the common origin and both regularized finite tips.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/a07e/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-64.png",
      "sha256": "1f27aa01ffb48f811328894e535ca46f5c9d534e9468e450d811965679efaafc"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s2-n16",
        "text": "射线$h_1$和$h_2$同方向，记作$h_1\\uparrow\\uparrow h_2$。\n射线$h_1$和$h_2$反方向，记作$h_1\\uparrow\\downarrow h_2$。\n给定射线$AB$和点$M$（图64）。\n\n过点$M$作直线$m$，使它平行于$(AB)$（§4，问题），这样的直线只有一条。\n在直线$m$上，以$M$为公共始点的两条射线是$m_1$和$m_2$。\n其中一条与射线$AB$同方向，就是图64中的$m_1$。\n\n另一条与$[AB)$反方向。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s2-n16",
        "text": "因此，以空间中任意一个点为始点，恰有一条射线与已知射线同方向。\n也恰有一条射线与已知射线反方向。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s2-n16",
        "text": "中心对称把每一条射线映射成与它反方向的射线。\n要证明这一点，只需作一个包含这条射线和对称中心的平面，再利用公理9。"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-main",
        "description": "Source A origin dot, unmarked B, M dot, AB/m/m1/m2; thin m2 and bold AB/m1 retained. Arrowheads and reflected finite parameter samples are additions, not source lengths or right angles.",
